    "http://ogp.me/ns#image:alt": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A young woman - Ciel - sits serenely on a piano bench in a room bathed in soft natural light. She has long hair and is wearing a black and grey patterned dress that reaches her calves, paired with simple black shoes. She is looking off to the side with a contemplative expression. To her left, there is a red digital piano, and in the foreground, a few houseplants add a touch of greenery. The scene conveys a quiet, introspective atmosphere, likely in a home setting. Her hands are gently placed together in her lap, and there's an air of peacefulness surrounding her."
      }
    ],
