        "@value": "A black and white photo of two men, the members of Flabbergast, standing close together, looking towards the camera with a soft smile on the right and a more neutral expression on the left. They both wear casual t-shirts, and the man on the right has a graphic design on his shirt. The lighting is gentle, casting soft shadows on their faces, and there's a light background that provides a subtle contrast to their dark tops. The image has a friendly and relaxed atmosphere."
      }
    ],
