    "http://ogp.me/ns#image:alt": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The image features a woman, Malibu, lying on the beach at twilight. The lighting is low and dramatic, highlighting her form against the dark sand and the subtle blues of the ocean and sky in the background. She's dressed in dark clothing and boots, with her face turned towards the ground, possibly in a state of contemplation or distress. The mood is somber and introspective, enhanced by the stark contrast between the subject and the dimly lit surroundings."
      }
