    "http://ogp.me/ns#image:alt": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "It appears to be a portrait of Yu Su with a bob haircut, looking into the camera with a confident expression. She’s wearing a sleeveless, high-collared yellow top with a vibrant, painterly pattern in reds and greens. Visible on her arm is at least one delicate tattoo—its outline looks like a stylized landmass or abstract shape. Her makeup includes dark eyeliner that accents her eyes, and her pose has an almost dance-like quality, with one arm raised gracefully. The background is a clean, pale tone, drawing attention to her colorful outfit and tattoos."
      }
    ],
