        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This is a color portrait featuring machìna with platinum blond hair parted down the middle, with strands framing their face. She is wearing a pleated gold top that covers the shoulders and has a metallic sheen. Large gold earrings complete the look. Her expression is both intense and slightly enigmatic, and she gazes confidently at the camera. The background is a very pale gray, which helps emphasize their face and the reflective quality of the gold garment."
