        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A black and white portrait of a man, Pole, with a confident half-smile. He has short, wavy hair and is wearing a black button-up shirt. The lighting on his face is soft, creating gentle shadows that accentuate his features. The background is dark, focusing the attention on his expression and the subtle details of his appearance. His relaxed demeanor and direct gaze convey a sense of approachability and warmth."
