      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The image features three people - the members of Mesocosm - in a black and white photo, set against an urban park backdrop with bare trees and high-rise buildings. The person in the foreground, a man, is seated and wears sunglasses, a hat, and a heavy coat, looking directly at the camera. Behind him, slightly out of focus, another man stands dressed in a hood and scarf, also wearing glasses and looking towards the camera. To the right, a woman with a pixie cut and sunglasses completes the trio, her face partly turned away, giving a side glance to the camera. The overall mood is casual yet styled, capturing a cool, urban vibe."
      }
