    "http://ogp.me/ns#image:alt": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This is a color portrait of a person photographed against a bright yellow background. They have short, textured hair and a neatly trimmed beard, and they’re wearing dark sunglasses. Their shirt appears to be a black, silky pajama top with contrasting yellow trim along the collar and button placket. The image has a slightly blurred or color-shifted effect, giving it a dynamic, almost neon aesthetic. They also wear a thin necklace, and the lighting casts warm red and orange tones on their face and clothing. The overall mood is bold, modern, and vibrant."
      }
