    "http://ogp.me/ns#image:alt": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The image features a surreal and abstract scene with multiple figures interacting with shiny, metallic-textured letterforms that spell \"FRACTAL FANTASY.\" The figures are rendered with a glossy, skin-like texture, and some are partially entwined by translucent, tentacle-like forms. The background is dimly lit, emphasizing a dreamlike atmosphere accentuated by soft, glowing lights that highlight the contours of the figures and the text. The overall composition blends elements of digital art with a mysterious, almost otherworldly aesthetic."
      }
    ],
