        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In a dimly lit space, a man, Martin Messier, stands in contemplation under a striking array of vertical beams of light, reminiscent of rain. The beams seem to originate from above, out of the darkness, and land in bright, scattered spots on the floor where the individual is centered. The scene creates an ethereal and otherworldly atmosphere, highlighting a moment of isolation or introspection. The person's silhouette and the surrounding light patterns are set against an otherwise enveloping darkness."
