      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A person with a contemplative expression looks off into the distance. Their hair is pulled back to reveal their profile, with a striking green streak adding a pop of color. They wear a textured, dark blue top with a glossy, almost liquid-like appearance, draped elegantly across the shoulders and chest. The lighting is soft and even, creating a gentle contrast with the darker tones of the attire and the light background, which provides a minimalist backdrop to this portrait."
      }
    ],
