        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A black and white image capturing a moment of musical passion. The subject is Colin Stetson, a man playing a baritone saxophone, fully engrossed in the performance. He is wearing a sleeveless tank top, displaying toned arms, and his facial expression shows intensity and focus. The tank top features Japanese script, adding a touch of personal style. The saxophone's details, from its keys to its curves, are highlighted by the light, contrasting with the dark background. The man's closed eyes and the slight downward tilt of his head suggest a deep connection with the music he's creating."
      }
