        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A monochrome photograph captures a person with a hooded garment draped over their head. They have a fringe hairstyle and wear a dark top. A distinctive sculptural accessory with curved, branch-like metal structures protrudes from their waist, creating an intriguing and artistic contrast against their simple attire. The backdrop is an aged wall with visible wear, and the light filtering through the window adds depth and texture to the composition. The overall mood is edgy and thought-provoking."
      }
