        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Priori\nA man, Priori, sits crouched against a vivid orange background. He has a full beard and is wearing a camouflage cap, a striped sweater with prominent shades of blue and orange, and a black leather jacket. His hands are clasped in front of him, and he has a pensive expression as he looks off to the side. The warm tones of the photograph give off a casual yet thoughtful vibe.\nJek\nA man with a thoughtful expression, Jek, is standing in a lush green environment. He has medium-length hair tucked behind his ears and is wearing a light beige shirt. His direct gaze seems to invite a sense of connection with the viewer. The natural backdrop provides a tranquil and refreshing atmosphere, suggesting a moment of quiet or reflection outdoors."
