        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An intricate and colorful digital artwork displaying a dense array of abstract shapes and patterns. The image features swirling clusters of orbs and geometric forms, connected by a network of delicate, web-like lines. The overall effect is reminiscent of an otherworldly, organic structure, illuminated by a variety of soft, glowing hues against a dark background."
      }
