    "http://ogp.me/ns#image:alt": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A softly lit, analogue‑style portrait shows Aurora Halal with shoulder‑length, wavy dark hair seen in the right‑profile against a clear, pale‑blue sky. Her head tilts slightly downward, eyelids lowered, revealing subtle rose‑gold eyeshadow and a hint of pink on the lips. A fine, silver chain rests at the base of the neck above the thin straps of a light, cloud‑patterned camisole that exposes the shoulders. Sunlight grazes the skin, giving it a warm glow, while faint film grain, speckles, and a vertical scratch lend the image a nostalgic, 35 mm aesthetic. In the lower‑right corner, the soft silhouette of a distant rooftop anchors the outdoor setting without drawing focus from the serene, contemplative subject."
      }
    ],
