    "http://ogp.me/ns#image:alt": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The photograph shows Valentina Magaletti seated on the floor of a stark, high-contrast studio set. She wears a black tracksuit with a reflective stripe down the sleeve and modern sneakers, one foot tucked under her and the other extended. In her right hand she holds a wooden drumstick, while behind her a single snare drum and a cymbal fallen to the floor hint at her instruments. The white backdrop has been torn away in jagged shards, revealing deep shadows and casting the scene in a cool blue-white light. Her dark hair with bangs frames a calm, focused expression as she gazes toward the camera, the interplay of light, texture and broken paper creating a sense of controlled disruption and quiet intensity."
      }
    ],
