    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image:alt": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This image captures Valentina Magaletti in action during a live electronic performance bathed in deep blue stage light. She stands behind a table piled with gear—a laptop running Ableton Live, a drum machine, keyboards and various synth modules—holding a pair of drumsticks as if ready to strike. To her left, upsammy, wearing a baseball cap and a black T-shirt printed with a spiral motif, leans in over a MIDI controller, equally absorbed. In the background, an attentive crowd watches under shafts of blue illumination. Microphones on boom stands arc over the setup, cables snake across the table, and the whole scene radiates an energy of improvisation and sonic experimentation."
      }
    ],
