    "http://ogp.me/ns#image:alt": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This portrait of Loidis shows them seated before a softly blurred, vertically paneled backdrop. He leans forward, hands gently clasped in front of their mouth, conveying a quiet, introspective mood. Loidis wears an olive-green knitted sweater over a white shirt and a well-worn olive baseball cap that casts a soft shadow over their brow. Dark hair peeks out from beneath the cap, framing clear, contemplative eyes that meet the camera. A simple hoop earring glints at his left ear. The shallow depth of field and muted, natural lighting emphasize the texture of the sweater and the thoughtful tension in their pose, creating an intimate, reflective atmosphere."
      }
    ],
