        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This image captures an immersive audiovisual performance, with a silhouetted performer working behind a table, surrounded by vibrant, psychedelic projections on the backdrop. The visuals feature a mesmerizing blend of colors and cosmic-like patterns, enhancing the sensory experience. The setup highlights the fusion of electronic music and digital art, as the audience is enveloped in the dynamic atmosphere. The use of immersive lighting and projections creates an engaging and otherworldly environment, perfect for an experimental performance at a digital arts festival."
      }
