    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Office address​  1201 Boul. Saint-Laurent Montréal, QC H2X 2S6 Canada Phone +1 (514) 871-8646  For any questions, contact us at info@mutek.org   Team   Founder, General and Artistic Director – Alain Mongeau General Co-Director – Claudine Hubert Assistant General Director – Lola Baraldi   Strategic Development Director – Katharina Meissner Funding, Strategic Projects and Exhibitions Officer – Sarah Ève Tousignant Development and Funding Officer – Marie Drapeau    Programming | Festival – Alain Mongeau, Marie-Laure Saidani, Vincent Lemieux Music Curator – Vincent Lemieux Music Curator and Project Manager – Marie-Laure Saidani Logistics & Administration Coordinator – Ingrid Cloutier-Robertson  Hospitality and MUTEK Market Coordinator – Léa Lahoud Booking Inquiries – prog@mutek.org   Programming | Forum – Alain Mongeau, Kahentawaks Tiewishaw, Katharina Meissner, Lola Baraldi, Marie-Laure Saidani, Sarah Mackenzie , Tiana Mclaughlan Director of MUTEK Forum and Creative Development – Sarah Mackenzie  MUTEK Forum Programming Coordinator – Fei Wong-Alary  MUTEK Market | Market and Industry Relations Consultant – Alexandra Idiart-Benavides   Marketing and Communications Director – Thomas Giboudeaux Digital Content and Marketing Manager – Gregh Chevron Communications Assistant – Megan Pietrus  Digital Platforms (mutek.org) – Akufen Press Relations – Rugicomm  Sponsorships and Partnerships Officer – Marius Levy   Production Director – Maude Laberge Sustainability Manager – Lola Baraldi    Technical Direction – Productions Main Droite Technical Director – Étienne Labelle-Sylvestre Scenography – Arnaud Belley-Ferris Sound – HQ Audio Lighting – CR34TE Backline – Le Dep du Tech   Financial Controller – Aurélie Rigoni Accounting – Gen Hutter, Simon Vincent   Executive Producer | Village Numérique – Mikaël Frascadore   Board of Directors   Chair – Raphaëlle Huysmans (Vice-President and Partner, URBANIA) Vice-Chair – Pascale Daigle (Head of Arts and Culture Division, City of Laval) Treasurer – Lisa Baillargeon (Vice-Rector, UQAM) Secretary – Albéric Maillet (Business Design Lead, Nurun) Director – Alain Mongeau (General and Artistic Director, MUTEK) Director – Jason Della Rocca (Co-founder, Execution Labs) Director – Lina Kachani (Artist Manager, Bonsound) Director – Roger Parent (President, Rêver Debout Inc.) Director – Catherine Lareau (Business Development Manager, Moment Factory) Director – Isabelle Kalar (Lawyer, Fasken)"
