    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Whether you aspire to reshape your brand narrative, amplify awareness, or seamlessly unveil your latest developments to an engaged audience, MUTEK serves as the conduit to manifest your objectives. Support Emerging Talent MUTEK provides access to boundary-pushing artists, creatives and technologists in Montreal and beyond. Join a real happening in digital creativity to: Benefit from content association with a leading clientele Contribute to the development of cultural diversity Create a tangible experience Support MUTEK’s sustainability achievements and goals Companies that have trusted MUTEK in Montreal and around the world: Ableton, Absolut, Adidas, Air Canada, BeatConnect, Desjardins Caisse de la Culture, Canada Media Fund, EA Motive, Estrella Damm, Hennessy Very Special, KDDI, LANDR, Mazda, Movistar, Nissan, Panasonic, Red Bull, Reebok, Roland, Samsung, SEAT, Sony, Soundworks, TouchDesigner, Ubisoft, Unreal Engine/Epic Games, Vans, among others."
      }
    ],
