    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Except for strictly necessary cookies, no cookie is placed without your explicit consent. Provider: Axeptio Purpose: Store consent choices Legal basis: Necessary for service operation 2.2 Audience measurement & cultural data (Pixel Culture) With your consent, we use Pixel Culture , provided by Data-Coop Culture , to collect anonymous browsing data for cultural audience analysis2 Purpose: Audience measurement and cultural analytics Data type: Anonymous browsing data Legal basis: Consent 2.3 Social networks & advertising platforms With your consent, cookies from the following platforms may be used to identify visitors and measure content performance: Facebook (Meta) TikTok Reddit These cookies may allow the platforms to recognize users and measure interactions with content or advertisements. Depending on your choices, Google may process data according to the following categories: Analytics storage : measure site usage and performance Ad storage : store advertising-related information Ad personalization : personalize ads shown to you Ad user data : share activity data with Google These settings are applied strictly according to your consent choices in Axeptio."
      }
    ],
