    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "\"In its eighth consecutive year, MUTEK has become the “crème de la crème” of digital arts festivals in North America, and over the course of five days in May/June proved itself again with stellar performances… MUTEK offers not only a taste of tons of different music, but a damn good tour around Montreal's finest venues as well.\" – XLR8R Accueillant 116 artistes et inscrivant un record de 29 premières, canadiennes ou nord-américaines, le Festival reste plus convaincu que jamais de la nécessité de présenter la création émergente."
      }
    ],
