    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "\"MUTEK 2006 was perhaps one of the best festival experiences I've ever had […] getting better and better across its five days of programming.\" – Philip Sherburne 110 artistes participent à cette 7 e édition du Festival de Montréal, présentant une série de nouveaux venus."
      }
