        "@value": "2020"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "\"The third presentation of Montréal’s MUTEK from May 29 to June 2, 2002 convincingly argued for its stature as the preeminent experimental electronic music festival in North America, one that rivals Sonar as an overarching barometer of electronica in its ever-mutating state.\" – Grooves (États-Unis) Poursuivant son travail de défrichage de talents nationaux et internationaux, l’édition 2002 présenta plus de 50 artistes, et les étiquettes Playhouse , Klang , et Orthlorng Musork firent également partie de la programmation."
      }
    ],
