    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The afro centred collective known as  Moonshine  comes together for  SMS FOR LOCATION - Live edition . Known globally for their lunar-based raves celebrating African and Electronic music, the crew is here to bring fire to the digital stage.  From a rooftop overlooking South West Montreal, Pierre Kwenders, CA/CD San Farafina, CA/QC and Bonbon Kojak , CA/CD gather on the decks to drop original Moonshine music complimented by the talented vocalist Odile Myrtil, CA/QC and the spirited percussion of Elli Mbonda.  CA/CD  Presented by  Nyege Nyege  and  TransmissionMTL    SMS FOR LOCATION - Live edition  is presented as part of Stream On, a project by MUTEK, with the support of the Canada Council for the Arts ."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/inLanguage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "en"
      }
