        "@value": "POP Montreal et MUTEK present: All Hands/Make Light + Thanya Iyer + Malika Tirolien + Korea Town Acid + Vagina Witchcraft Doors open at 2:30 pm | Show starts at 3 pm-9 pm Setlist 3 pm | Vagina Witchcraft 4 pm | Korea Town Acid 5 pm | Malika Tirolien 6:15 pm | Thanya Iyer 8 pm | All Hands_Make Light PROOF OF VACCINATION REQUIREMENTS POP Montreal Staff will ask to see your vaccination passport or proof of double vaccination to enter the venue or outdoor performance space."
      }
