    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "MUTEK presents: Ouri and guests + Saudade + visuals by VJ Boycott March 12, 2022 Doors open at 8 pm Club Soda 35$* (tx+fs included) Despite our efforts, it is with great regret that we announce that Smerz will be unable to join us tonight due to bad weather conditions in New York City. Facebook —— Smerz (NO) Smerz, the Norwegian duo of Henriette Motzfeldt and Catharina Stoltenberg, seamlessly weave together techniques and sounds pulled from the chamber and classical music, hip hop, R&B, and hard electronics, with the end product always resulting in something altogether uncanny. Photo credits: Image courtesy of Smerz Ouri (FR/QC) Of French and afro-caribbean descent, Ouri is a Montréal-based electronic producer, DJ, and multi-instrumentalist. Photo credits: Bruno Destombes Saudade (CA/QC) Saudade is a musical duo started by Montréal-born musicians Marilou Lyonnais-Archambault and Nela Paki in 2018."
      }
    ],
