    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "MUTEK & Hinter live presents: Korea Town Acid + Ouri + San Farafina 3 streams, 3 artists, and a goal of 8000 trees planted: MUTEK and Hinter live co-present the next season of the Hinter live sessions, stripped-back and recorded in Canadian national parks, in a project promoting the harmony between music and reforestation. February 8: Korea Town Acid February 22: Ouri March 8: San Farafina *Each show will premiere as a livestream at 8pm, and will be available on-demand on the virtual platform afterward."
      }
    ],
