    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Set times: 22h00 - 23h20 - Juju Le Moko 23h20 - 23h55 - Zaya Solange 23h55 - 00h55 - Juju Le Moko 01h00 - 02h00 - Sinjin Hawke & Zora Jones 02h00 - 03h00 - M. Bootyspoon Surround Visuals: Gabe Liberti Doors open at 9:30 pm OASIS immersion - 301 rue Saint-Antoine Ouest (Les Galeries du Palais). About the artists Sinjin Hawke & Zora Jones (CA/QC) (Live) - Sinjin Hawke's innovative club productions draw from the complex rhythms of grime, footwork, contemporary rap, and the fluidity and grandeur of classical music. Along with frequent collaborator Zora Jones , Hawke is the co-founder of the audio-visual platform Fractal Fantasy. Juju Le Moko (CA/QC) (DJ set) Juju Le Moko’s unbridled sound has been brewing in the city's local clubs and parties."
      }
    ],
