        "@value": "Additionally, she anticipates the release of her first vinyl, a collaboration with Michael Red titled \"ORO AZUL.\" DJ, record store owner, programmer at MUTEK, and co-founder of the labels Musique Risquée and Copier/Coller, Vincent Lemieux is a passionate music enthusiast. Known for his all-encompassing involvement in Montreal's electronic music scene, Vincent Lemieux has also been producing music for over 15 years. In his role as boss, A&R, and jack-of-all-trades for the label Musique Risquée, which he founded with Marc Leclair (Akufen) in 2003, and Copier/Coller with Guillaume Coutu-Dumont, which started in 2023, he has always showcased local talent."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/inLanguage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "en"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
