      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Autechre , consisting of Sean Booth and Rob Brown, released their most recent music in November 2024 on Warp Records. AE_2022– is a series of extended pieces recorded in front of live audiences around the world between 2022 and 2024 (so far).  In 2025, Autechre will embark on their first North American tour in ten years, including a stop in Montréal on October 24. The ticket sale has ended; no exchanges, no refunds.  Some of these performances are expected to feature material from their ongoing project of new music, AE_2022–. Mark Broom will provide support on this tour.   Please note: Standing show. Autechre's performance takes place in complete darkness with a high sound volume, which may disrupt individuals sensitive to loud noises or those with hearing impairments.  evenko, MUTEK, Neon, and SAT reaffirm their commitment to inclusion and accessibility at their events and uphold a zero-tolerance policy for harassment in all its forms."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/inLanguage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "en"
      }
