    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "To get ready for the upcoming edition of the Festival, MUTEK and Jardins Gamelin invite you to a free electronic night.  Join Montréal-based talents Juju le Moko , Icky Magdala , Honeydrip , and Sinjin Hawke as DJ sets and live performances animate this open-air space in the Quartier des Spectacles in Montreal.  Dancehall, dub, and bass music await you on Friday, July 18, from 5 PM to 11 PM."
      }
    ],
