    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Reinvented through constant collaboration with other artists and his own alter-egos, Dandy Jack 's feel-good club sound symbolizes a decades-long quest to intensify links between German techno's origins and the Chilean rhythms the long-time producer grew up with."
