        "@id": "https://montreal.mutek.org/en/artists/stefan-goldmann"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Changing techno from within, Stefan Goldmann has created his uniquely own form of contemporary art music. Unified by a sharp focus in defining distinct aesthetic phenomena and an evolutionary approach to creating new variants within techno, seemingly disparate outings form a cohesive, nearly hermetic body of work: What are the inner workings of electronic music? Stefan Goldmann performs worldwide, including at the SXSW, Mutek, Time Warp and Club To Club festivals."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Stefan Goldmann"
      }
    ]
  },
