    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Map.ache is Jan Barich , Dj-producer based in Leipzig better known for his releases on Giegling and also part of the DJ duo Manamana. He runs the KANN record label together with Alex Neuschulz and Dennis Knoof with highly regarded releases by Sevensol, Bender,Traumprinz or Falke."
