    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "From Moroccan parents and born in Torelló, Ikram has been living in Barcelona for almost a decade, where she has begun to develop her artistic facet as a producer and DJ, playing in most of the city's clubs and festivals (Nitsa Club, MUTEK, Club Marabú, Loom, Voodoo Club, etc.)."
      }
