      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An expertly curated and evolving collective of electronic artists, Circle Of Live smothers stages in equipment to take a deep dive into the immediate physicality of live music and the entire nightlife experience itself, particularly its unexpected moments of beauty and wonder. Conceived of by Swedish artist Sebastian Mullaert,  Circle Of Live links artists and their machines for hours-long, unhindered, improvised performances that honour spontaneity, improvisation, curiosity and being fully present in the moment. Mullaert designed  Circle Of Live  as an elastic setup allowing participants to plug in and drift in and out of performances at will."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Circle Of Live: Pantha Du Prince, Leafar Legov & Sebastian Mullaert"
      }
    ]
  },
