        "@value": "Tadleeh  IT  For MUTEK, Tadleeh will present her own universe, both dark and ethereal: an experimental electronic music that will plunge you into a very special atmosphere.   Presented by  Insomnia  as part of the SHAPE Platform, funded by Creative Europe."
      }
