    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "He began his music career in the late nineties, in New York, as a producer for a series of electronic music showcases held inside the Brooklyn Bridge Anchorage, a venue that quickly gained a reputation as a one-of-a-kind and attracted the likes of Thomas Brinkmann, Dimbiman, Carl Craig, Ryoji Ikeda, and Pole."
