        "@id": "https://montreal.mutek.org/en/artists/alexandre-burton"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Artist and digital luthier, Alexandre Burton is interested in technology to unveil new sensitivities specific to the digital. Minimal and refined, his work focuses on the description and organization of relations between different modes of expression. His works are regularly featured in international digital art and music events. In addition to his activities within the digital/virtual context, he collaborates with other artistic and cultural entities as an artistic director and a technology integration consultant."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Alexandre Burton"
      }
    ]
  },
