    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Iron man knows about Ronk: “It’s true, they can do magic! Six invisible german streetboys know best how to win Super 7 lotto while drinking supersized pitchers and eating juicy Hackfleisch with Sauerkraut. If they do not actually vaulting on sausages in your wet dreams, they sell self made Michelangelos in their lousy studio in Leipzig City. They are really happy to come to Miami to take part in MUTEK with their watercolor painting sets.”"
      }
    ],
