    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Nathan McNinch is not just a one-trick pony. Composer and musician, but also designer, student, and creator of the petite sono] label and the online arts journal/gallery 'n'fold', he's concerned with contemporary creation and participates actively on the scene. With seven CDRs produced under his own name over last few years, there's no doubt that the asKaa environment will benefit from his overtures and his inveterate curiosity..."
