    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "If Nicolas Sfintescu (AKA DJ Freak, founding member of the Circus Company label) and Ezechiel Pailhes simply defined themselves as a “French group that makes music,” the recent edition of their second LP allows us to conclude that they’re also a group that wants to rock."
