    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "After moving to Berlin, he began experimenting with digital hardcore as part of the duo EC8OR (with Cobra Killer's Gina V. D'Orio), and quickly signed to Alec Empire's DHR label, at the time Germany's preeminent digital hardcore outlet."
