    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "From the east of Germany and established in Berlin, Carsten Nicolai plays off his various backgrounds: known in the contemporary art world for his installations, he's also equally recognized by electronic scene aficionados for his individual productions designed under the pseudonym of Noto or Alva Noto and with collaborators such as Ryoji Ikeda, Mika Vainio of Pan Sonic, Ryuichi Sakamoto."
