        "@id": "https://montreal.mutek.org/en/artists/sasha-smirnova"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Sasha Smirnova is a visual artist who is exploring digital media for audiovisual performances and installations. With her work, she aims to combine artistic practice and nightlife searching for unexpected combinations of shapes and colors that lead to new sequences creating a feedback loop of visual experiences  Her works have been shown at: Black Box Music Center in Helsinki; Roskilde Festival; Griessmuehle, Urban Spree, about blank, and CTM Festival as part of MusicMakers HackLab in Berlin; Parallel Festival, Teorema Festival, LAUT, Haimney Gallery in Barcelona, Färgfabriken in Stockholm, and others."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Sasha Smirnova"
      }
    ]
  },
