    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "COR3A — Same Old Fear, Conditional Trigs, Run Run Run  COR3A is a new sound art group created by three members, ZRO , HEO , and WYM in 2018. The three members, who had been involved in various music activities, including pop and electronic music, formed a sound art group under the name of COR3A for expanded art experiences that incorporate electronic music, sound art, audiovisual and media art."
      }
    ],
