    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "KnovCompile — Reconstructive   KnovCompile is an artist group that combines Knob , Visual , and Compile to show works that utilize graphics, light, and sound that fit the unique characteristics of the space every time. They are going to show a Reconstructive, which uses reflective displays to produce laser sequences of geometric graphic images, showing that each channel is utilized in a mutually organic manner."
      }
    ],
