    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "softcoresoft  CA/QC Live | World Premiere  For her MUTEK comeback, softcoresoft presents a brand new live set with the special collaboration of Alvaro Echánove . Taking inspiration from flamenco’s rhythms (“palos”) and singing (“cante”) as a point of departure, the performance brings those influences into the electronic realm, borrowing from the language of acid, techno, house, reggaeton and baile funk."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "softcoresoft"
      }
    ]
  },
