    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Her local performances have included MUTEK Montréal (2018 and 2017 as Demora), Piknic Électronik, Igloofest, Stereo nightclub, OCTOV, Exposé Noir, Never Apart, POP Montréal, LIP and Datcha as well as countless raves and loft parties."
