    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Daito Manabe  JP  – latent body Live A/V  After captivating audiences in Tokyo and Barcelona, Japanese artist Daito Manabe , founder of Rhizomatiks , brings his latest audiovisual performance to MUTEK Montréal this summer. With generative visuals, Manabe explores everyday materials and phenomena, uncovering essential potentialities of the human body, data, programming, and computers. Experience a unique blend of analog and digital, real and virtual."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Daito Manabe"
      }
    ]
  },
