    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Ai.step is a performance unit consisting of musician Kakuya Shiraishi and visual artist Scott Allen. In their performance Shiraishi and Allen collaborate with an AI algorithm that live codes in the programming language TidalCycles synthesizing unpredictable sonic endeavours that feed into generative data visualization."
