    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Their approach with sound materials is comparable: they enjoy capturing live sounds, digital errors, digital synthesis, and above all mixing all these sources up.Constantine heads the interesting Internet label Panospria, so you can bet several representatives will be participating in these two avant-garde music programs."
      }
