    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "He has had a long ongoing relationship with Berghain and Ostgut Ton, having released two LPs and various EPs as one half of Barker & Baumecker and hosting regular nights at the club since September 2008 as co-founder of the label Leisure System."
