    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "His productions and his powerful DJ sets reflect his own universe and diverse inspirations, mixing a powerful, psychic and dancing Techno. His former residence at the famous parties ‘La Factory’ in the South of France has allowed him to share the stage with monuments of the international Techno scene such as Jeff Mills, SLAM, Derrick May, Ben Sims, Karenn, Rebekah, FJAAK, Recondite, Ellen Allien or Marcel Dettmann."
      }
    ],
