        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Half of the Olde Gods duo, Barcelona-based DJ and producer JMII have released their latest projects on various record labels, including Mathematics Recordings, 100% Silk and Hivern Discs. Now a major member of the local electronic scene, JMII continues to challenge its own sound and expand its synth lines to create rhythms geared towards minimalism and dance music.  Translation provided by Google Translate"
