        "@value": "Loraine James will perform a live set with her usual trusted setup: Ableton Live, a MIDI keyboard, Novation Launchpad and Launch Control, APC40 MKII, and a MacBook —- heavy glitch, bouncing kick drums, strange percussive elements, and quiet vocal lines that create alien sounds and rhythms. As for the rest, it’s anyone’s guess."
