    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "GOLPESAR  I R/QC — A Body Without, and in Need  For MUTEK, Montréal-based, Iranian Canadian queer artist and musician GOLPESAR (Rouzbeh Shadpey) has prepared a special live version of his forthcoming record A Body Without, and in Need . With electric guitar, avant-garde electronics, and spoken word, GOLPESAR will enact a communal ritual of self-mourning where evil eyes are dispelled, monolithic selves are unsounded, and memory is allowed to flood. Visuals by Sam Bourgault ."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "GOLPESAR"
      }
    ]
  },
