      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "All is Well CA/QC — A Break in Time World Premiere For his first live show, All is Well (aka Fred Everything) will perform his new album - A Break In Time , an ambient album written during the lockdown as a sort of calming therapy/meditation exercise."
