        "@id": "https://montreal.mutek.org/en/artists/bianca-shonee-arroyo-kreimes"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Bianca Shonee Arroyo-Kreimes  CR/QC — Field of Reeds  What would it be like to live in a world where all non-human living things were extinct? Shonee ’s Field Of Reeds is an augmented-reality experience inviting participants to make connections with the urban spaces they see every day. In the place where real meets virtual, once-thriving speculative ecosystems are unveiled. Set in an alternate future, the app transforms modern life into a vibrant jungle once again shared with nature through the renewal of a lost relationship with Mother Earth."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Bianca Shonee Arroyo-Kreimes"
      }
    ]
  },
