    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Ida Toninato & Claude Bastien (TREBUCHET)  CA/QC — Listening to the Walls  Listening to the Walls is the virtual reality experience brainchild of Ida Toninato and Claude Bastien , of VR studio TREBUCHET, inviting users to explore the reverberating soundscape of an old bunker. Through their interactions, participants will delve ever deeper in an immersive audiovisual universe created in situ. The project was first presented earlier this year during Atelier Grand Nord XR’s 5th edition."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Ida Toninato & Claude Bastien (TREBUCHET)"
      }
    ]
  },
