        "@id": "https://montreal.mutek.org/en/artists/pierre-zandrowicz-ferdinand-dervieux"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Pierre Zandrowicz & Ferdinand Dervieux  FR — What is Left of Reality  Pierre Zandrowicz and Ferdinand Dervieux ’s What is Left of Reality explores a form of suffering and psychological and existential distress caused by environmental changes: eco-anxiety. This scan-based documentary experience examines the people who feel lost in the face of a changing planet and fear for the survival of the life it holds. It offers an exploration of a world in 3D via a screen that captures the user's body’s movements."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Pierre Zandrowicz & Ferdinand Dervieux"
      }
    ]
  },
