        "@id": "https://montreal.mutek.org/en/artists/sammy-lee-m-j-harding"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Sammy Lee & M. J. Harding  CA/KR/UK+UK — SONG  Sammy Lee ’s SONG unpacks the global phenomena of K-pop into a multi-faceted narrative that contextualises the genre’s success against a backdrop of post-war trauma, globalization, Cold War ideology, and Korean cosmology. Weaving together found footage and CGI animation with a soundtrack by M. J. Harding , SONG moves between states of spiritual purity and digital psychosis, charismatic idols, suicides, customizable light sticks, and the IMF crisis."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
