    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Claire & Alicia Hush  CA/QC — Planete Lush  Longtime friends and aficionados of the micro-house movement, they have a shared sensibility for bouncy basslines, and feel the most free expressing themselves fully and honestly as pilots of a dancefloor. For 2021, just for fun, why not try a live improvised collaboration - blending Alicia Hush ’s instinctive four-to-the floor drum programming with Claire ’s penchant for synthesizers and mysterious melodies, together they take you to Planet Lush!"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Claire & Alicia Hush"
      }
    ]
  },
