      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Softmatter  RU/QC  Softmatter will be performing a new live set featuring tracks from her upcoming EP Hyle alongside other recently unreleased material, which explores themes such as the process of realignment/reconnection with self through conscious inquiry. Discover her performance on the free outdoor stage on August 25."
      }
