      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://montreal.mutek.org/en/artists/kenya20hz"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://montreal.mutek.org/en/artists/kenya20hz"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "KENYA20Hz  BR — It Was All A Dream  Rio-based DJ, music producer and curator, KENYA20Hz , brings to MUTEK 2021 It Was All a Dream , a performance inspired by her latest research and authorial productions. Along with the visual and cinematic interventions made by the digital artist Gabriel Koi (BR) in a performance that bounds sound and movement, the appalling intensity of the bass is driven by alternatives genres of electronic music as Post-dubstep, Braindance and Leftfield Techno, in a flow of psychoacoustic experiences presented in a sci-fi and hypnagogic scenario.  Appears as part of AMPLIFY  D.A.I  , an initiative of the  British Council  in partnership with MUTEK Montréal, MUTEK Buenos Aires,  Artlab  in Argentina,  Oi Futuro  in Brazil and  Somerset House Studios  in the UK. The programme is supported by  Canada Council for the Arts  ,  Instituto Nacional de la Música  and  Fundación Williams  ."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "KENYA20Hz"
      }
    ]
  },
