      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Jump Cut #4 CA/QC+DE+ES+UK In Jump Cut #4 , an extraterrestrial life form visits the earth to stratify itself in a geologic formation that produces an anomaly in humans' phenomenological time consciousness who come into contact with this place."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
