        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Across four days of performances and professional exchanges in Shibuya, Tokyo’s vibrant hub of creativity, nightlife, and innovation, the 10th edition of MUTEK.JP celebrates a decade of exploration, experimentation, and community building in Japan’s electronic music and digital art scene."
